<title>UK: Essen Hypo adds 500 mln marks to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Essen Hypo adds 500 mln marks to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 1.5 billion marks from 1.0 billion marks, joint lead managers Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and Trinkaus and Burkhardt said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HYPOTHEKENBANK IN ESSEN AG</p>
<p> AMT ** 1.5 BLN DEM   COUPON     5.5	 MATURITY    20.FEB.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE **98.235   PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5	LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	**ORIGINAL 1.0 BLN DEM LAUNCHED 13.FEB AT 98.245</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   22.5 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
